{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "八道关口",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 107.54,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.148
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "审计不是安全的起点，也不是终点。",
   "spoken": "审计不是安全的起点，也不是终点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.58,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 3.58,
   "speechEnd": 6.72
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "它是流水线上的一个关口。",
   "spoken": "它是流水线上的一个关口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 7.16,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 7.16,
   "speechEnd": 9.037
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "它之前要有设计和测试，之后要有监控和应急。",
   "spoken": "它之前要有设计和测试，之后要有监控和应急。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 9.46,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 9.46,
   "speechEnd": 13.891
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "打个比方，合约开发像造一架飞机。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，合约开发像造一架飞机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 14.88,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 14.974,
   "speechEnd": 17.765
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "设计时画图纸，写下任何情况下机翼都不能断。",
   "spoken": "设计时画图纸，写下任何情况下机翼都不能断。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 18.22,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 18.22,
   "speechEnd": 22.689
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "每个零件出厂前都要测，还要放进风洞，用各种极端风向去吹。",
   "spoken": "每个零件出厂前都要测，还要放进风洞，用各种极端风向去吹。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 23.16,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 23.254,
   "speechEnd": 28.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "外部机构做适航认证，它不查每一颗螺丝，只抽查关键系统。",
   "spoken": "外部机构做适航认证，它不查每一颗螺丝，只抽查关键系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 28.82,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 28.911,
   "speechEnd": 33.995
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "飞上天以后，有黑匣子和地面雷达，出了事有应急程序。",
   "spoken": "飞上天以后，有黑匣子和地面雷达，出了事有应急程序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 34.4,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 34.4,
   "speechEnd": 39.215
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 39.66,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 39.753,
   "speechEnd": 41.254
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "飞机出厂后，还能召回维修。",
   "spoken": "飞机出厂后，还能召回维修。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 41.72,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 41.72,
   "speechEnd": 43.957
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "不可升级的合约，部署之后，就再也不能修改。",
   "spoken": "不可升级的合约，部署之后，就再也不能修改。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 44.42,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 44.523,
   "speechEnd": 48.235
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "所以前面的关口，必须更严。",
   "spoken": "所以前面的关口，必须更严。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 48.64,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 48.64,
   "speechEnd": 51.004
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "把这条流水线展开，一共八个关口。",
   "spoken": "把这条流水线展开，一共八个关口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 51.42,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 51.515,
   "speechEnd": 54.183
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "规格与威胁模型，安全编码规范，静态分析。",
   "spoken": "规格与威胁模型，安全编码规范，静态分析。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 54.6,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 54.693,
   "speechEnd": 59.394
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "单元、模糊和不变量测试，关键模块的形式化验证。",
   "spoken": "单元、模糊和不变量测试，关键模块的形式化验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 59.78,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 59.872,
   "speechEnd": 64.853
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "外部审计或竞赛，安全部署与权限移交。",
   "spoken": "外部审计或竞赛，安全部署与权限移交。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 65.28,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 65.28,
   "speechEnd": 69.444
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "最后是监控、漏洞赏金、应急响应和保险。",
   "spoken": "最后是监控、漏洞赏金、应急响应和保险。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 69.9,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 69.9,
   "speechEnd": 73.675
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "越靠左的关口，修复越便宜，规格阶段发现的问题，只要改文档。",
   "spoken": "越靠左的关口，修复越便宜，规格阶段发现的问题，只要改文档。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 74.12,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 74.213,
   "speechEnd": 79.274
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "静态分析、测试和形式化验证是自动的，每次提交代码都该跑一遍。",
   "spoken": "静态分析、测试和形式化验证是自动的，每次提交代码都该跑一遍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 79.7,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 79.791,
   "speechEnd": 85.625
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "静态分析误报多，不求零告警，要求每个告警都有结论。",
   "spoken": "静态分析误报多，不求零告警，要求每个告警都有结论。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 86.08,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 86.175,
   "speechEnd": 91.435
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "审计发现的问题，要反过来补成测试，防止以后再犯。",
   "spoken": "审计发现的问题，要反过来补成测试，防止以后再犯。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
   "start": 91.82,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 91.82,
   "speechEnd": 96.366
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "但所有关口都有一个前提，你想到了要检查什么。",
   "spoken": "但所有关口都有一个前提，你想到了要检查什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-22.wav",
   "start": 96.76,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 96.852,
   "speechEnd": 100.826
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "经济攻击和跨协议的组合风险，常常要专门的经济审计。",
   "spoken": "经济攻击和跨协议的组合风险，常常要专门的经济审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg2-23.wav",
   "start": 101.22,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 101.316,
   "speechEnd": 106.145
  }
